1
00:00:02,983 --> 00:00:07,672
Reminders and the goals digest. Get nudged when a check-in is due

2
00:00:08,189 --> 00:00:15,316
Reminders work for metrics with a schedule. Set Check in every on a metric to daily, weekly or monthly.

3
00:00:15,457 --> 00:00:19,379
On the Reminders page, turn on Send me reminders.

4
00:00:19,475 --> 00:00:28,471
Choose where they go: your email, or services like Telegram, Slack or ntfy. One address per line.

5
00:00:28,583 --> 00:00:32,714
The examples on the right show the address format for each service.

6
00:00:32,819 --> 00:00:41,049
The goals digest is a summary of what moved, what's at risk and what's due. Daily, or weekly on the day you pick.

7
00:00:41,142 --> 00:00:45,529
Click Save, then Send a test to check it arrives.

8
00:00:45,653 --> 00:00:51,363
You get one message per due date, listing everything overdue. No repeated nagging.
